# PSR-4b-exports — host-private contraction (partial)

## Scope

| Work | In this wave | Deferred |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Peel host-private exports with **zero** external consumers | Yes (−۵) | — |
| Touch manifest-bound `./host/*` surfaces | **No** | Later waves |
| Retarget `./host/draft` web tests → package root | **No** | PSR-4b-exports-2 |
| Reach ≤30 host-visible | Partial (۳۹→۳۴) | Remaining −۴ |

Land commit: `7a6147e5`

Machine inventory:
[`psr-4b-exports-inventory.yaml`](./psr-4b-exports-inventory.yaml)

Classification baseline (frozen):
[`psr-4a-denali-export-classification.yaml`](./psr-4a-denali-export-classification.yaml)

## Method (per-export proof)

A host-private export may be removed only when **all** hold:

1. **Not manifest-bound** — no `workspace.manifest.json` module path that
   `importSpecifier()` maps to this `./host/*` key.
2. **Zero live exact-path consumers** under `apps/`, `packages/`, `scripts/`
   (PCRE2 `(?!/)` so longer subpaths do not false-positive; `codemods/` excluded).
3. **Replacement path documented** — root `.`, sibling `./host/<parent>`, or
   remaining leaf export.

## Peeled this wave (−۵)

| Export | Replacement | Why safe |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `./host/plugin-for-wizard-engine` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali` | Root still exports; only historical codemod |
| `./host/denali-plugin-build` | `@app-tour/workspace-denali` | Root still exports; only historical codemod |
| `./host/clone/hydration` | `./host/clone` | Parent re-exports hydration symbols |
| `./host/smoke/phase-6-denali-smoke-tenant` | package root | `devBootstrap.smokeTenant` codegen uses `m.package` |
| `./host/marketing` | `./host/marketing/marketing-catalog-surface` | Parent barrel unused |

