## Ratchet

`scripts/ops/psr-4b-exports-smoke.mjs`:

- peeled keys absent from `package.json`
- zero live consumers for peeled keys
- `host_private ≤ policy.host_private_ceiling` (34 this wave)
- inventory metrics match live package.json

## Explicit non-goals

- Do **not** delete manifest-bound chrome/settings/finance/http surfaces.
- Do **not** bulk-delete the 80 `product-internal` shrink candidates without
  separate proof (they are not the host-visible −۹ gap).
- `configure-*` product adapters remain (host-imports train).
